# Go 转 Java 文件上传代码

## 关键修改点说明

| Go 代码 | Java 代码 | 说明 |
|--------|----------|------|
| `http.HandleFunc` | `@RestController + @PostMapping` | Spring Boot 路由注解 |
| `r.FormFile("file")` | `@RequestParam MultipartFile file` | Spring 文件上传参数 |
| `os.MkdirAll` | `Files.createDirectories` | 创建目录 |
| `io.Copy` | `file.transferTo` | 文件内容复制 |
| `defer` | `try-with-resources` | 资源自动关闭 |

## 完整可运行代码

### 1. Maven 依赖 (pom.xml)
```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<project xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0"
         xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         xsi:schemaLocation="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0 
         http://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd">
    <modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>

    <groupId>com.example</groupId>
    <artifactId>file-upload</artifactId>
    <version>1.0.0</version>
    <packaging>jar</packaging>

    <parent>
        <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
        <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-parent</artifactId>
        <version>3.2.0</version>
    </parent>

    <dependencies>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
            <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-web</artifactId>
        </dependency>
    </dependencies>

    <build>
        <plugins>
            <plugin>
                <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
                <artifactId>spring-boot-maven-plugin</artifactId>
            </plugin>
        </plugins>
    </build>
</project>
```

### 2. 主应用类 (FileUploadApplication.java)
```java
package com.example;

import org.springframework.boot.SpringApplication;
import org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure.SpringBootApplication;

@SpringBootApplication
public class FileUploadApplication {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        SpringApplication.run(FileUploadApplication.class, args);
    }
}
```

### 3. 文件上传控制器 (FileUploadController.java)
```java
package com.example;

import org.springframework.http.ResponseEntity;
import org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.PostMapping;
import org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RequestParam;
import org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RestController;
import org.springframework.web.multipart.MultipartFile;

import java.io.IOException;
import java.nio.file.Files;
import java.nio.file.Path;
import java.nio.file.Paths;
import java.nio.file.StandardCopyOption;

@RestController
public class FileUploadController {

    private static final String UPLOAD_DIR = "uploads";

    @PostMapping("/upload")
    public ResponseEntity<String> uploadFile(@RequestParam("file") MultipartFile file) {
        try {
            // 创建上传目录（如果不存在）
            Path uploadPath = Paths.get(UPLOAD_DIR);
            Files.createDirectories(uploadPath);

            // 构建保存文件的完整路径
            Path filePath = uploadPath.resolve(file.getOriginalFilename());

            // 保存文件
            Files.copy(file.getInputStream(), filePath, StandardCopyOption.REPLACE_EXISTING);

            return ResponseEntity.ok("文件已成功保存到：" + filePath.toAbsolutePath());
        } catch (IOException e) {
            return ResponseEntity
                .status(500)
                .body("无法保存上传文件：" + e.getMessage());
        }
    }
}
```

### 4. 配置文件 (application.properties)
```properties
# 服务器端口
server.port=8080

# 文件上传大小限制
spring.servlet.multipart.max-file-size=50MB
spring.servlet.multipart.max-request-size=50MB
```

## 运行方式

```bash
# 1. 编译项目
mvn clean package

# 2. 运行应用
java -jar target/file-upload-1.0.0.jar

# 3. 测试上传（使用 curl）
curl -X POST -F "file=@/path/to/your/file.txt" http://localhost:8080/upload
```

## 主要优化点

1. **使用 Spring Boot** - 简化 Web 开发配置
2. **try-catch 异常处理** - 替代 Go 的 error 返回
3. **ResponseEntity** - 统一 HTTP 响应格式
4. **Files.copy** - Java NIO 高效文件操作
5. **配置化** - 通过 properties 文件配置上传限制

