# JDBC 安全查询示例代码

## 1. 不安全的做法（❌ 禁止使用）

```java
// 危险：直接拼接用户输入，易受 SQL 注入攻击
public User unsafeQuery(Connection conn, String username) throws SQLException {
    String sql = "SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = '" + username + "'";
    Statement stmt = conn.createStatement();
    ResultSet rs = stmt.executeQuery(sql);
    // 处理结果...
    return null;
}
```

**风险示例：** 用户输入 `' OR '1'='1` 会导致查询所有用户数据。

---

## 2. 安全的做法（✅ 推荐使用）

```java
import java.sql.*;

public class SafeJDBCExample {

    // 安全查询：使用 PreparedStatement
    public User safeQuery(Connection conn, String username) throws SQLException {
        String sql = "SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ?";

        try (PreparedStatement pstmt = conn.prepareStatement(sql)) {
            // 设置参数（自动转义，防止注入）
            pstmt.setString(1, username);

            try (ResultSet rs = pstmt.executeQuery()) {
                if (rs.next()) {
                    User user = new User();
                    user.setId(rs.getInt("id"));
                    user.setUsername(rs.getString("username"));
                    user.setEmail(rs.getString("email"));
                    return user;
                }
            }
        }
        return null;
    }

    // 安全的多条件查询
    public List<User> safeMultiQuery(Connection conn, String username, 
                                     Integer age, String email) throws SQLException {
        StringBuilder sql = new StringBuilder(
            "SELECT * FROM users WHERE 1=1"
        );
        List<Object> params = new ArrayList<>();

        if (username != null && !username.trim().isEmpty()) {
            sql.append(" AND username LIKE ?");
            params.add("%" + username + "%");
        }

        if (age != null) {
            sql.append(" AND age = ?");
            params.add(age);
        }

        if (email != null && !email.trim().isEmpty()) {
            sql.append(" AND email = ?");
            params.add(email);
        }

        try (PreparedStatement pstmt = conn.prepareStatement(sql.toString())) {
            for (int i = 0; i < params.size(); i++) {
                pstmt.setObject(i + 1, params.get(i));
            }

            List<User> users = new ArrayList<>();
            try (ResultSet rs = pstmt.executeQuery()) {
                while (rs.next()) {
                    User user = new User();
                    user.setId(rs.getInt("id"));
                    user.setUsername(rs.getString("username"));
                    user.setEmail(rs.getString("email"));
                    users.add(user);
                }
            }
            return users;
        }
    }

    // 安全的批量插入
    public void safeBatchInsert(Connection conn, List<User> users) throws SQLException {
        String sql = "INSERT INTO users (username, email, age) VALUES (?, ?, ?)";

        conn.setAutoCommit(false);
        try (PreparedStatement pstmt = conn.prepareStatement(sql)) {
            for (User user : users) {
                pstmt.setString(1, user.getUsername());
                pstmt.setString(2, user.getEmail());
                pstmt.setInt(3, user.getAge());
                pstmt.addBatch();
            }
            pstmt.executeBatch();
            conn.commit();
        } catch (SQLException e) {
            conn.rollback();
            throw e;
        } finally {
            conn.setAutoCommit(true);
        }
    }
}

// 用户实体类
class User {
    private int id;
    private String username;
    private String email;
    private int age;

    // Getter 和 Setter 省略
    public int getId() { return id; }
    public void setId(int id) { this.id = id; }
    public String getUsername() { return username; }
    public void setUsername(String username) { this.username = username; }
    public String getEmail() { return email; }
    public void setEmail(String email) { this.email = email; }
    public int getAge() { return age; }
    public void setAge(int age) { this.age = age; }
}
```

---

## 3. 完整测试示例

```java
public class JDBCSecurityTest {

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String url = "jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/test_db";
        String user = "root";
        String password = "password";

        try (Connection conn = DriverManager.getConnection(url, user, password)) {
            SafeJDBCExample example = new SafeJDBCExample();

            // 即使输入恶意字符串，也不会被注入
            String maliciousInput = "' OR '1'='1";
            User result = example.safeQuery(conn, maliciousInput);

            System.out.println("查询结果: " + (result == null ? "无数据" : "安全"));

        } catch (SQLException e) {
            e.printStackTrace();
        }
    }
}
```

